<li>de Onis, Juan. "Motive Unknown." New York Timfes 26 March 1975: 1 &amp; 8.</li>
<li>Pace, Eric. "Rumors of a Beheading Draw Crowds in Riyadh." New York Times 5 April 1975: 3.</li>
</ul>

